 diffusely nodular  There is one discrete nodule that measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and appears tan white  Representative sections of the specimen are placed in cassettes A J with the suspicious lesion in cassette E  The skin ellipse was a serially sectioned and entirely placed in cassette AA  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  additional inferior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm unoriented piece of adipose tissue  The specimen is to reveal a firm tan white homogenous mass that measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The entire specimen is submitted in cassettes K P  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final inferior margin long suture inferior margin  short bracket inferior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 9cm piece of adipose tissue with a very long and four short stitches marking the extent of the true margin  The entire margin is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal yellow adipose tissue with numerous white firm fibrotic appearing bands throughout the tissue  and a discrete white fibrous appearing mass that measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm and lies 1 2cm from the inked margin  Representative sections all including the margin are placed in cassettes Q Z with samples containing the suspicious mass in cassettes Q W  The skin ellipse was serially sectioned en face and entirely submitted in cassette AA  Resident  STEWART M  KNOEPP  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  LUMPECTOMY PART B  BREAST RIGHT ADDITINAL INFERIOR MARGIN  EXCISION PART C  BREAST RIGHT FINAL INFERIOR MARGIN  EXCISION , Poor_(grade_III).
