beled  left breast re excision biopsy  consist of two separate  portions of tissue  The first is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  strip of fibroadipose  tissue with a 2 8cm  long  0 2cm  wide strip of skin with scar along one  aspect  This portion of tissue is inked  cross sectioned and has fat necrosis  underlying the skin surface  It is serially submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The  second portion is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 8cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue marked  with two sutures  The margins throughout are inked black  At one end there is  a long suture oriented as medial  according to the designation provided on the  requisition   and the area around this is double inked blue  Ninety degrees to  this there is a short suture oriented as inferior  according to the designation  provided on the requisition  of the left breast  Based on these orientations   the deep surface is double inked red  The specimen is cross sectioned from the  medial end towards the lateral end revealing a central REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm   partially cavitary  partially blood clot filled area with surrounding fat  necrosis  This is located primarily at the mid to lateral end of the specimen  in the superior and superficial part  Surrounding fat necrosis extends in  other areas as well  Otherwise  there is primarily yellow lobulated adipose  tissue with thin strands of rubbery  white fibrous tissue  No focal lesions  seen  The entire specimen is submitted from medial to lateral as ten equal  cross sections with some having subdesignations of  A  for inferior and  B  for  superior and are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with some having subdesignations A   B   18 agg  all   Specimen B labeled  left breast final deep margin  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  1 0cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue which is sectioned and reveals primarily  lobulated adipose tissue  It is entirely submitted sequentially in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3  agg  all   Specimen C labeled  left breast final medial margin  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue which measures between REMOVED_DATE to 0 8cm  It is  marked on one surface with a suture designated as  surface furthest from  thick tumor  and this side is inked black  The specimen is cross sectioned and  serially submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   4 agg  all   Specimen D labeled  left breast final inferior margin  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue which measures between REMOVED_DATE to 0 6cm  thick   One surface is marked with a suture oriented as  surface furthest from tumor    This surface is inked black  It is cross sectioned and serially submitted in   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 agg  all   Specimen E labeled  left breast final anterior margin  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  x 1 2cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue which is sectioned and entirely  submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 agg  all   Dictated by  DDK____ signature on file ____DENNIS J  FEEN  M D  REMOVED_DATE  Final   ____ signature on file ____DANIEL D  KOELLIKER  M D  REMOVED_DATE  Final    report_end  , Poor_(grade_III).
