ntified  The residual carcinoma is present as multiple residual foci within  the tumor bed  each 80  cellular as was the pre treatment carcinoma  that  appear viable  The overall cellularity over the entire tumor bed is  approximately 10   This would be consistent with a Miller Payne response score  of 3 or a Residual Cancer Burden score of REMOVED_DATE  RCB II    Immunoperoxidase studies for ER  PR  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu will be performed and  reported in an addendum   This carcinoma would be classified as AJCC  6th edition  yp  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID a  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID a with  multiple foci of invasion   CLINICAL DATA   History  50 year old female S P R breast core bx on REMOVED_DATE  revealing poorly  differentiated Grade III III IDL  FNA     for R axillary lymph node    neoadjuvant treatment   Operation  R MRM   Operative Findings  None given   Clinical Diagnosis  Right breast cancer   TISSUE SUBMITTED   A 1  Right breast  short   superior  long   lateral  bow tie on axilla   B 2  Axillary contents right   Attention  Breast Service  neoadjuvant chemotherapy  GROSS DESCRIPTION   The specimen is received fresh  in two parts  each  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s  name  and medical record number   Part A    1  Right breast   and consists of a modified radical mastectomy  specimen   REMOVED_CASE_ID  grams  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 9cm   with a tan white skin ellipse  22 6  x 16 9cm   that includes a wrinkled tan brown areola  7 0 x 5 6cm   and a  centrally located everted nipple  1 5 x 1 0cm   and lateral tissue  6 5 x REMOVED_DATE  x 4 4cm    and three orienting sutures  per surgeon  long   lateral  short    superior  bow tie   axilla   Present on the surface of the skin is an  ill defined area of erythema located in the lower outer quadrant  4 5 x 6 7cm    and at the junction of the upper and lower inner quadrants  4 3 x 5 1cm    Deep  to the nipple and 4cm to the deep margin  inked black  is an ill defined  yellow white  slightly fibroti