entative  tissue is snap frozen and submitted for cytogenetics   Micro REMOVED_DATE  superior margin  2 frags  RSS  Micro 3  inferior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 4  anterior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 5  posterior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 6  lateral margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 7  medial margin  1 frag  RSS  aji  Reports to  IGLEHART  JAMES  DIRK M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS   report_end  , Poor_(grade_III).
