rous parenchyma  The nipple is unremarkable  The axillary nodes are as large as 1 5cm in diameter and they have firm  irregular  white tan cut surfaces  Section Code A D   representative sections from the previous biopsy site E   deep margin F G   representative sections from irregular firm  stellate area adjacent to biopsy cavity H   skin with healing incision I   nipple J M   axillary lymph nodes  from medial to lateral  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST   report_end  , Well_differentiated_(grade_I).
