ity or immunoreactivity in  10  of tumor  cells   Negative  1    Faint weak immunoreactivity in  10  of tumor cells but  only a portion of the membrane is positive   Positive  2    Weak to moderate complete membrane  immunoreactivity in  10  of tumor cells   Positive  3    Moderate to strong complete membrane immunoreactivity  in  10  of tumor cells   Cytoplasmic immunoreactivity alone is scored as a negative result   Some of the reagents used in these assays may be approved for investigational  use only   CLINICAL DATA   History  A 68 year old female with RUI 6mm pleomorphic calcifications  associated with a density   Operation  11g stereotactic breast core biopsy  Clinical Diagnosis  R O invasive cancer  TISSUE SUBMITTED  Right stereotactic core biopsy  2 green cassettes    A  with  calcifications and  B  no calcification   GROSS DESCRIPTION  by SHAH RAJSHRI N  M D   The specimen is received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit  number  and  right breast   and consists of two  2  light green cassettes  One  cassette is labeled  A  with calcifications and contains multiple  soft   fragmented  yellow to pink tissue cores  1 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in aggregate    The other cassette is labeled  B  and contains similar tissue fragments  2 5 x  1 5 x 0 4cm in aggregate    Micro 1   A   multi frags  ESS   Micro 2   B   multi frags  ESS   jks  Reports to  LEUNG  JESSICA  WAI M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY IES    report_end  , Moderate_(grade_II).
